PASTE_YOUR_TMDB_V3_API_KEY_HERE

--------------------------------------------------------------------
This is a template. To use it:

  1. Make a copy of this file named exactly:  tmdb.key
  2. Open tmdb.key, delete everything, and paste your TMDB v3 API key
     as the only thing in the file. No quotes, no "key=", just the key.
  3. Save.

tmdb.key is gitignored, so it never gets committed or pushed. This
example file is committed so the setup is documented for next time.

Get a key at: themoviedb.org -> Settings -> API -> v3 auth
--------------------------------------------------------------------
